_en": "", "syarah_id": "", "syarah_source": "", "related": [], "grade_en": "", "grade_id": "", "lidwa_id": null, "grade": ""}, {"id": "11", "hadith_number": "11", "chapter_id": "0", "text_ar": "لَا یَحِلُّ لِمُؤمِنٍ اَنْ یَّجُهْرَ أخَاهُ فَوقَ ثَلَاثَةِ أیَّامٍ", "text_ar_plain": "لا یحل لمؤمن ان یجهر أخاه فوق ثلاثة أیام", "text_en": "It is unlawful for a believer to sever relations with his brother for more than three days.", "text_id": "", "text_ur": "", "rawis": [], "paths": [], "syarah_ar": "", "syarah_en": "", "syarah_id": "", "syarah_source": "", "related": [], "grade_en": "", "grade_id": "", "lidwa_id": null, "grade": ""}, {"id": "12", "hadith_number": "12", "chapter_id": "0", "text_ar": "لَیْسَ مِنَّا مَنْ غَشَّنَا", "text_ar_plain": "لیس منا من غشنا", "text_en": "He is not one of us who cheats us.", "text_id": "", "text_ur": "", "rawis": [], "paths": [], "syarah_ar": "", "syarah_en": "", "syarah_id": "", "syarah_source": "", "related": [], "grade_en": "", "grade_id": "", "lidwa_id": null, "grade": ""}, {"id": "13", "hadith_number": "13", "chapter_id": "0", "text_ar": "مَا قَلَّ وَكَفَى خَيْرٌ مِمَّا كَثُرَ وَأَلْهَى", "text_ar_plain": "ما قل وكفى خير مما كثر وألهى", "text_en": "A little that suffices is better than an abundance that distracts.", "text_id": "", "text_ur": "", "rawis": [], "paths": [], "syarah_ar": "", "syarah_en": "", "syarah_id": "", "syarah_source": "", "related": [], "grade_en": "", "grade_id": "", "lidwa_id": null, "grade": ""}, {"id": "14", "hadith_number": "14", "chapter_id": "0", "text_ar": "الرَّاجِعُ فِيْ هِبَتِهِ کَالرَّاجِعِ فِيْ قَیْئِهِ", "text_ar_plain": "الراجع في هبته کالراجع في قیئه", "text_en": "Someone who takes back his gift is like someone who eats his vomit.", "text_id": "", "text_ur": "", "rawis": [], "paths": [], "syarah_ar": "", "syarah_en": "", "syarah_id": "", "syarah_source": "", "related": [], "grade_en": "", "grade_id": "", "lidwa_id": null, "grade": ""}, {"id": "15", "hadith_number": "15", "chapter_id": "0", "t